  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the pancetta and cook until crispy, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the white wine and cook until it has almost completely evaporated, about 2 minutes.",
    "Add the Italian seasoning, dried oregano, and mustard. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the dum and cook for 2-3 minutes, until slightly browned.",
    "Season with caster sugar, whole black pepper, and Grana Padano cheese.",
    "Serve hot."
